<title>USA: GE subsidiary buys Barclays Factoring SpA.</title>
<headline>GE subsidiary buys Barclays Factoring SpA.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Electric Capital Services, a wholly owned subsidiary of General Electric Co, said on Tuesday that it bought Barclays Factoring SpA, a subsidiary of Barclays Financial Services Italia SpA. The terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The Milan-based company would become a part of GE Capital Services' commercial finance business and change its name to GE Capital Factoring SpA.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
